[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4699993685","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120227#issuecomment-4699993685","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120227","id":4699993685,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGCQ2VQ","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-13T22:34:18Z","updated_at":"2026-06-13T22:34:18Z","body":"Yes","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4699993685/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4701564913","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120227#issuecomment-4701564913","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120227","id":4701564913,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGDwv8Q","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-14T11:12:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-14T11:54:20Z","body":"Update on the issue, a Critical part was found, the issue only happens for updating lights, but if they don't need to update they will fill up properly over time, so it's only a problem for Mass Dynamic Lights (like in my game)\n\nTo see this behavior in action just kill the rotation part of the script in the MRP and you can see them filling up over a second or so.\n\nI am unable to determine if CPU performance can cause the allocation count to change because I cannot drop my CPU's clock speeds because Microsoft f-ed up Power Plans and they are being flat out ignored\n\nThis is the MRP result on an i3 10105f on 4.6.3 stable\n\n<img width=\"1144\" height=\"654\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b399952-1385-4f5a-83aa-55a81a8b511b\" />\n\n~Also looking at the code, 500 msec is supposed to be the reallocation limit, however that would mean that reallocations should stall the game to run at 2 FPS, so something is wrong there (as it runs at 60), it's likely the issue is mixing msec and usec, causing an out way too early. so capping it to like 0.5 msec instead of 500 msec, and just increasing that limit should resolve the problem, by a factor of 1000x if it is indeed a msec-usec usage getting mixed and causing the problem.~\nTesting with the realloc tolerance increased to 5000 from 500 did not do anything","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4701564913/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4717947579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120227#issuecomment-4717947579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120227","id":4717947579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGTYquw","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-16T10:51:55Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T11:17:25Z","body":"Interesting find, Dual Paraboloid omni lights fill significantly better \n\n<img width=\"1158\" height=\"652\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eaedfab1-cc03-4410-ab3e-119f90b4eb64\" />\n\nStill not Perfect mind you...\n\nCubemap 256x4 quadrants\n\n<img width=\"1153\" height=\"652\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79cc6165-9ecd-49fe-a866-a86ac4846f7e\" />\n\nDual 256x4 quadrants\n\n<img width=\"1154\" height=\"657\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be1e1959-a31f-4bad-bc2b-713377a38b1f\" />\n\nOk so Spot lights also seem to be limited to 512 dynamic shadow slots, much like the dual paraboloid omni lights while cubemap omnis are limited to 158","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4717947579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4741285261","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120227#issuecomment-4741285261","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120227","id":4741285261,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGppFjQ","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T11:01:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T11:01:31Z","body":"This isn't related to the shadow atlas. There are too many dynamic lights, always hitting the 512 shadow pass limit, so there aren't any chance for lights later in the list to be updated. \n\nYour MRP ends up creating 4080 shadow passes every frame. It works if I change [MAX_UPDATE_SHADOWS](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.h#L60) to 8192:\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88ffd228-bb6a-468b-999c-4cfe338690a4\" />\n\nThere probably needs to be some kind of mechanism to allow all dynamic lights to update.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4741285261/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4745367805","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120227#issuecomment-4745367805","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120227","id":4745367805,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGtiQ_Q","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T19:18:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T19:18:04Z","body":"yea this needs to be configurable. It's actually quite cool to know this kind of feature exists.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4745367805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4851306490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120227#issuecomment-4851306490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120227","id":4851306490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABISkP-g","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-01T07:06:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T07:06:10Z","body":"I've been thinking a bit about this. why not just set it to 8192?\n\nI mean it would cost performance for those that do have more shadows in a scene, and if they really do go for hundreds or thousands of shadowed lights that are moving about, the user is def going to understand that there will be major performance costs to doing so...\n\nI feel it's preferable to introducing bugs when users unknowingly run into this, and I don't see any negative side effects for those that aren't spamming shadowed lights, unlike say changing Clustered Element Limits which has a VRAM and Performance cost associated with it's value as long as you have any lights at all.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4851306490/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]